{
  "$comment": "Phase B: the agents' 'Measurements to run', re-run on CI runners (AGENTS.md rule 6), one job per id (carton-measure.yml, measure.mjs). A step is {label, cwd (relative to carton/), run, env, stdoutTo?, repeat?, failPattern?}; {node}, {electron}, {tmp}, {results}, {pwModules} are filled in. A report reads a results file: jsonl rows grouped by `groupBy`, every numeric field (nested ones as dotted paths) given as median and every run, minus `ignore` (exact keys or prefixes). A report's `expect` ({rows, cells, runsPerCell}) and `noErrors` (an array field that must be empty) make an incomplete run fail; `failPattern`: a failed run of a repeated step counts as an observation only if its output matches it, any other failure fails the measurement.",
  "measurements": [
    {
      "id": "stores-sqlite-cells",
      "agent": "stores",
      "claim": "store-sqlite open / commit / readlog at 10k and 100k changes (notes: Measurements to run, 1)",
      "timeout": 60,
      "steps": [
        {
          "label": "bench/run.ts: build 10k and 100k carton.db, then 7 rounds of every cell, one fresh process each, rotated order",
          "cwd": "packages/store-sqlite",
          "env": {
            "KF_ITEMS": "1000",
            "GFV_LOCK": "{tmp}/cpu.lock",
            "LOAD_MAX": "1.5",
            "OTHER_MAX": "0.5"
          },
          "run": [
            "{node}",
            "bench/run.ts",
            "{tmp}/sqlite",
            "7",
            "{results}/raw-sqlite.jsonl",
            "10000,100000"
          ],
          "stdoutTo": "{results}/sqlite-run.log"
        }
      ],
      "reports": [
        {
          "file": "raw-sqlite.jsonl",
          "groupBy": [
            "id"
          ],
          "ignore": [
            "round",
            "loadBefore",
            "loadAfter",
            "otherCoresBefore",
            "uptime",
            "gateWaitS",
            "waitedS",
            "at",
            "node",
            "head",
            "keyframeSeq"
          ],
          "expect": {
            "cells": 8,
            "runsPerCell": 7
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "stores-sqlite-recheck",
      "agent": "stores",
      "claim": "S1 and S3 again after stores' fixes (14ff3cb one bound per side; 969db35 checkpoint outside the write lock): the open and commit cells only, stores' re-run command (notes: Measurements to re-run after Stage F)",
      "timeout": 45,
      "steps": [
        {
          "label": "bench/run.ts open|commit cells, fresh databases, 7 rounds",
          "cwd": "packages/store-sqlite",
          "env": {
            "KF_ITEMS": "1000",
            "GFV_LOCK": "{tmp}/cpu.lock",
            "LOAD_MAX": "1.5",
            "OTHER_MAX": "0.5"
          },
          "run": [
            "{node}",
            "bench/run.ts",
            "{tmp}/sqlite-recheck",
            "7",
            "{results}/raw-sqlite-recheck.jsonl",
            "10000,100000",
            "^(open|commit)"
